/span> <span class=\"token string\">\"active\"</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"object\" style=\"position:relative;\">Object<a href=\"#object\" aria-label=\"object permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>ScrollTrigger가 활성화 되면 <code class=\"language-text\">.my-selector</code>에 <code class=\"language-text\">active</code> 클래스를 추가합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token literal-property property\">toggleClass</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">targets</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'.my-selector'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">className</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'active'</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<iframe height=\"300\" style=\"width: 100%;\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"preventOverlaps and fastScrollEnd | ScrollTrigger | GSAP\" src=\"https://codepen.io/GreenSock/embed/ZEyXPGj?default-tab=html%2Cresult\" frameborder=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" allowtransparency=\"true\">\r\n      See the Pen <a href=\"https://codepen.io/GreenSock/pen/ZEyXPGj\">\r\n  preventOverlaps and fastScrollEnd | ScrollTrigger | GSAP</a> by GSAP (<a href=\"https://codepen.io/GreenSock\">@GreenSock</a>)\r\n  on <a href=\"https://codepen.io\">CodePen</a>.\r\n</iframe>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-tip\">\n<p>toggleAction은 toggleClass에 적용되지 않습니다. 클래스 이름을 다른 방식으로 토글 하려면 콜백을 사용합니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<br>\n<h5>참고</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://aluvy.github.io/gsap/demo/scrolltrigger-FastScrollEnd/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fast Scroll Trigger</a></li>\n</ul>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#scrolltrigger-toggleclass\">ScrollTrigger: ToggleClass</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#string\">String</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#object\">Object</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 6, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"ScrollTrigger: ToggleClass","summary":"ScrollTrigger: ToggleClass ScrollTrigger가 활성 또는 비활성을 전환할 때 요소에 클래스를 추가또는 제거 합니다. String ScrollTrigger가 활성화 되면 trigger에 active 클래스를 추가합니다. toggleClass: \"active\" Object ScrollTrigger가 활성화 되면","date":"May 29, 2024","categories":["GSAP"],"tags":[""],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/gsap/scrolltrigger_toggleclass/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/gsap/scrolltrigger_fastscrollend/","title":"ScrollTrigger: fastScrollEnd"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/gsap/from_fromto_immediaterender/","title":"from(), fromTo(): immediateRender"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}